WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:19.591
Ben: Look at all these pets!

2
00:00:19.592 --> 00:00:22.979
Theo: The judges look serious.

3
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:26.545
Whiskers is nervous!

4
00:00:26.546 --> 00:00:36.659
Skyler: Come on, let's get in line.

5
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.859
Chatter: Twinkle, twinkle, little star!

6
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.492
Skyler: Shh. Not yet, Chatter!

7
00:00:42.493 --> 00:00:47.244
Sarah: Look, that cat jumped through a hoop.

8
00:00:47.245 --> 00:00:50.960
Theo: I hope it doesn’t win first prize.

9
00:00:50.961 --> 00:00:54.433
Ben: The only trick Speedy knows is how to stand still.

10
00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:57.847
Riley: Don't worry. Snooks will win.

11
00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:05.574
Then we can all go to the zoo!

12
00:01:05.575 --> 00:01:13.072
Theo: You're next, Skyler!

13
00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.020
Judge 1: What trick will your parrot do?

14
00:01:16.021 --> 00:01:19.701
Skyler: Chatter will sing "Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star."

15
00:01:19.702 --> 00:01:22.065
Skyler: Okay, Chatter, sing!

16
00:01:22.066 --> 00:01:30.138
Chatter: Squawk! Clean up that mess!

17
00:01:30.139 --> 00:01:34.762
Judge 2: Thank you. Next, please!

18
00:01:34.763 --> 00:01:39.719
Skyler: Oh no. Chatter didn't do very well.

19
00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:46.398
Ben: Theo, it's your turn.

20
00:01:46.399 --> 00:01:49.867
Judge 1: What trick will your hamster perform?

21
00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:52.949
Theo: Whiskers will run around in circles.

22
00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:57.679
Go, Whiskers, run fast!

23
00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.359
Theo: No, Whiskers. Come back here!

24
00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:07.910
Judge 3: Ha-ha! That tickles!

25
00:02:07.911 --> 00:02:12.432
Theo: I'm sorry. Whiskers wasn't supposed to run away.

26
00:02:12.433 --> 00:02:18.869
But it was funny.

27
00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:22.474
Judge 1: Next, please!

28
00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.938
Ben: Riley, it's Snooks' turn.

29
00:02:24.939 --> 00:02:26.880
He has to win.

30
00:02:26.881 --> 00:02:31.398
Theo: Yeah, it’s our last chance to go to the zoo!

31
00:02:31.399 --> 00:02:35.456
Riley: Snooks, it's all up to you now.

32
00:02:35.457 --> 00:02:40.999
Snooks: Ar-ooo!
